{"script":"s_2_9_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]嗯？什、什么？想问希、希瑟小姐的事？那你找错人了，我、我我我一个臭皮匠怎么可能知道——[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]嘿！你可别装傻啦，埃达叔叔！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]呜啊！你、你这小丫头怎么会在这里？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]你喜欢希瑟老师的事情全班都知道！再向我们装傻，米莉就向老师告状！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]呜！你这小丫头……我知道了啦！你们想问什么就问吧！只要是我知道的，都告诉你们！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]哼～这就对啦！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]噗。明明是个大人，对小孩子还真没辙。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"（把事情原委告知埃达。）","tag":"tag_12"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[cm][show]原来如此……想要弄到鲜花啊。我的确是说过某个传言……但那也只是传言而已啊。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]哼哼！叔叔应该也正愁怎么安慰老师吧。毕竟看到希瑟老师不高兴，叔叔也自个儿着急好久呢！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]什、什么？我、我哪有……哎唷，好讨厌啊你这丫头！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]我……我是想过这个问题啦！可是你想想这里可是岩山，只有满地的石头和红水晶，你上哪去找鲜花啊？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]那就告诉我们那个传闻吧！有英雄们保护米莉，米莉肯定能找到鲜花送给希瑟老师的！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]即使你这么说……[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"没事，你放心说吧。","tag":"tag_19"},{"text":"我们会保护好米莉的。","tag":"tag_19"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[cm][show]唉……真拿你们没办法。听好了，我是听说过一个传闻。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]这还是大兽潮前，村里老人和我说过的。他们说，只要从天梯前往绝峰之上，那边有一片由天河灌溉的花田。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]绝峰之上有花田？我们也上去过，怎么没注意到？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]所以说啊，这只是一个传说，我也不知道具体的位置。唉，这么一想，我们还是放弃吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]不行，试都没有试过，怎么可以放弃！既然这样的话，那咱们就再去一次那里找找看吧！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]可是……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]嘿嘿……只要能在绝峰上找到花，米莉会在送花的时候特意提起埃达叔叔的名字的！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]唉？啊、别别别别别！已经够尴尬的了，这说出去可多难堪啊——[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嗯～{myName}，你怎么说？[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"也许在别的地方的确有花田。","tag":"tag_29"},{"text":"只要保护好米莉就没问题。","tag":"tag_29"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[cm][show]也是。恐怖蟾兽不在，凭我们的实力，上山也不算很危险了。[r]不过具体的位置不知道的话，可能还是得找好久……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]这个嘛……对了！米莉之前听说有一个背着花花草草到处流浪的商人！她曾说自己对花草非常了解，我们可以去找她问问！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]背着花花草草流浪的商人……？总觉得有点印象……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]不过都有现成的花草，那直接找她买下来不就行了……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]不～行～！米莉说过了一定要亲手在索利德山采到的才行啦！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_34"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]是是是，知道了啦，都说过好几次了……那我们就去找找这位商人吧？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_35"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"“顺风”米莉","text":"[show]嗯——！我记得上次给安娜姐姐送信的时候，她曾经说过在灾害研究所附近见过她！我们去那边找找吧！[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_36"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"关于老师希瑟……"}